isco?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pO7VZUvkCqs"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Lyrical Maturity Issue","body":"When DXX began their career, Oliver was in his early twenties, making lyrics about heartbreak and adolescent issues understandable. However, now in his thirties, an expected level of maturity in his lyrical expression is not prominently observed in the latest album. \"DXX era muy joven es cuando empezaron su carrera, tenía un poco más de 20 años, entonces esas letras y esa manera trágica hablar del desamor o de estos problemas que puede tener una persona postada al escente eran comprensibles pero ahora que tienen 30 años ya se despresopó en un grado de madurez en las letras o en la manera de expresar los sentimientos que no se ve especialmente en el álbum.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"I see you - The XX. ¿Un buen disco o un mal disco?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pO7VZUvkCqs"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":87566570332279,"type":"song","name":"Jean","work_year":1969,"list_id":279209370709843,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1969","src":"singles","rank":23,"year":1969,"note":"","yt":"hozEk-eCYwc","scaruffi":null},{"id":141446941873064,"type":"song","name":"Good Morning Starshine","work_year":1969,"list_id":279209370709843,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1969","src":"singles","rank":43,"year":1969,"note":"","yt":"-8jsHLP4L9I","scaruffi":null},{"id":87566570332279,"type":"song","name":"Jean","work_year":1969,"list_id":132335824845498,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","rank":23,"year":1969,"note":null,"yt":"hozEk-eCYwc","scaruffi":null},{"id":141446941873064,"type":"song","name":"Good Morning Starshine","work_year":1969,"list_id":132335824845498,"list":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","rank":43,"year":1969,"note":null,"yt":"-8jsHLP4L9I","scaruffi":null},{"id":23495432123700,"type":"album","name":"If You Need a Friend","list_id":196260309937989,"list":"RY